Package: @LIBDBG_PKG@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: @PKG_NAME@ (= @VERSION@)
Section: debug
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gcc.gnu.org/
Description: GNU Standard C++ Library @GCC_VERSION@ (debug build) for @PKG_NAME@
 A second build of libstdc++ compiled with -g3 -O0 -D_GLIBCXX_ASSERTIONS,
 with its debug information kept in place, installed in @PREFIX@/lib64/debug.
 Use it to step through the standard library in a debugger:
 .
   g++-@MAJOR@ -g app.cpp -Wl,-rpath,@PREFIX@/lib64/debug
 .
 or run an existing program with LD_LIBRARY_PATH=@PREFIX@/lib64/debug.
 Debug symbols for the regular, optimised libstdc++ are in @PKG_NAME@-dbgsym.
